@startuml RF12_Classes
title RF12 — Visualizar & Editar a página "Minhas Fotos" & Adicionar mais de uma peça por vez dentro do sistema\nDiagrama de classes — entidades JPA reais (fai-domain) e enums
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E4DEF0
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods

package "fai-domain · model" {
class Photo {
  +user: User
  +origin: PhotoOrigin
  +sourceEntityId: UUID
  +storageKey: String
  +publicUrl: String
  +originalUrl: String
  +thumbnailUrl: String
  +contentHash: String
  +width: Integer
  +height: Integer
  +qualityScore: BigDecimal
  +moderationStatus: ModerationStatus
  +keyMoment: boolean
  +editedFromPhotoId: UUID
  +metadataJson: String
  +deletedAt: Instant
}
class PipelineJob {
  +user: User
  +type: PipelineJobType
  +status: PipelineJobStatus
  +targetType: String
  +inputResourceId: UUID
  +resultJson: String
  +stagesJson: String
  +totalCostUsd: BigDecimal
  +errorCode: String
  +attempts: int
  +queuedAt: Instant
  +finishedAt: Instant
}
class WardrobeItem {
  +name: String
  +imageUrl: String
  +originalImageUrl: String
  +photoProcessingStatus: PhotoProcessingStatus
  +availabilityStatus: AvailabilityStatus
}
}
package "fai-domain · enums" {
enum PhotoOrigin {
  WARDROBE_ITEM
  SCHEME
  TRY_ON
  STYLE_DNA
  PROFILE
  BACKGROUND_STUDIO
  LOOSE
  EDITOR
}
enum PipelineJobStatus {
  PENDING
  RUNNING
  RENDERING
  ENHANCING
  COMPOSITING
  COMPLETED
  FAILED
  CANCELLED
}
enum PhotoProcessingStatus {
  NEW
  MODERATING
  PROCESSING
  COMPLETED
  NEEDS_REUPLOAD
  FAILED
}
}
package "fai-application · service" {
class PhotoService {
  +gallery(user, Filter, page, size): Map
  +insights(user): Map
  +delete(user, id, confirmed): Map
  +bulkDelete(user, ids, confirmed): Map
  +download(user, id): byte[]
  +setKeyMoment(user, id, key): Map
  +curate(user): Map
  +timeline(user): Map
  +saveEdit(user, id, bytes): Map
}
class WardrobeService {
  +analyze(user, bytes, category): Draft
  +analyzeBatch(user, files, category): List<Draft>
  +create(user, PieceForm): PieceView
  +createBatch(user, forms): List<PieceView>
  +reprocessPending(): int
}
class MultiPieceService {
  +detect(user, bytes): Detection
  +pieceDraft(user, draftId, index, bytes): PieceDraft
  +recreate(user, draftId, index, bytes, ...): AiImage
  +aiPieceDraft(user, draftId, aiImageId): PieceDraft
}
}
Photo --> PhotoOrigin
PipelineJob --> PipelineJobStatus
WardrobeItem --> PhotoProcessingStatus
Photo ..> WardrobeItem : sourceEntityId (origem WARDROBE_ITEM / EDITOR)
PhotoService ..> Photo : lista/exclui (deletedAt)
PhotoService ..> WardrobeService : peça sem imagem
WardrobeService ..> PipelineJob : rascunho PIECE_DRAFT
MultiPieceService ..> PipelineJob : MULTI_PIECE_DRAFT
WardrobeService ..> WardrobeItem : cria
note top of Photo : tabela photos
note top of PipelineJob : tabela pipeline_jobs\n(type FLAT_LAY_STANDARDIZATION;\ntargetType PIECE_DRAFT | MULTI_PIECE_DRAFT | PIECE_REPROCESS)
note bottom of WardrobeService : Draft(draftId, processedUrl, prefill, quality,\nmoderation, stages, rejection, ...) — lote de até 12 fotos
@enduml
